---
description: Route feature and ingestion reviews to the shared temporal-data knowledge.
globs:
  - src/algotrading_backend/feature_store/**/*.py
  - src/algotrading_backend/data_ingestion/**/*.py
  - src/algotrading_backend/entrypoints/feature_store.py
  - src/algotrading_backend/entrypoints/data_collector.py
alwaysApply: false
---

Apply this rule only in the `algotrading-backend` repository, identified from its project instructions/metadata and `src/algotrading_backend/` package. In any other repository, this rule does not apply.

Use the installed `code-quality` skill with **Decisions Use Available Information** → **Audit Temporal Data Validity**. Follow the project's AGENTS.md and `documentation/BAR_TIMESTAMP_CONVENTIONS.md`. Use the same route for relevant configuration changes or explicitly requested methodology reviews.
